  - m_Id: 7868747776
    m_Localized: Just drawing my favorite character in cosplay to heal myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79910113280
    m_Localized: I was so bored that I drew some cosplay illustrations. What kind
      of cosplay look do you all like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131567161344
    m_Localized: "Drawing while brainstorming a new cos for my OC\u2014waiting to
      hear everyone\u2019s thoughts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253705293824
    m_Localized: "After seeing the cosplayer\u2019s incredibly beautiful cosplay,
      I couldn\u2019t help but start drawing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
